  "heading_path": "本队论文模板（可填写版） / 摘要与关键词：一页内交付答案",
  "intensity": "BALANCED",
  "line_count": 12,
  "masked_text": "[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00267:2c769f1c3c93]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00268:e0d40f7ddeea]]写清对象和条件、每个分问采用的实际模型动作、最能区分方案的数值或关系、检验口径以及结论边界。不要把摘要写成方法名目录，也不要把尚未在正文或代码中产生的数字填进去。\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00269:921a3bfde588]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00270:7dd80fd5ed7e]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00271:9bd6563a665b]]\n围绕[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00272:1882aad786bc]]在[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00273:c47383755d14]]下的[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00274:685b2af77355]]，本文先由[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00275:60177c746974]]确定[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00276:bfa2b83827c0]]。对于问题一，[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00277:27c09814a3a2]]，得到[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00278:cf8c52eb5b92]]；对于问题二，[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00279:5ea854c40d2a]]，在[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00280:4ba9a94ebb77]]下求得[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00281:4cdd8135b89f]]；对于问题三，[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00282:3da258e8a2cf]]给出[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00283:dc1443f367c4]]。通过[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00284:9061d8b9d48e]]检查后，[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00285:a1e8e932d2d8]]在[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00286:e76fe606fffb]]内成立。[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00287:b11b4ca186c0]]\n关键词：[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00288:fac103884f2f]]；[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00289:31a8dfb0d57a]]；[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00290:077bcf045e36]]；[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00291:75e451f9d88d]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00292:6c1dc1fa6ece]]\n\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00293:92014dc36df1]]每个分问至少有一个可复核输出；数字能追到正文表/代码；单位前后一致；检验方法没有被夸大；[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00294:b7d7bede4af4]]等词后面紧跟比较对象、指标和范围。\n\n",
