  "read_only_context_before": "ae5742]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00240:6c327e891740]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00241:3000c3bd47e8]]\n分问 & 输入/证据 & 要求输出 & 硬约束或口径 & 交给下一问的接口[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00242:b11b4ca186c0]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00243:3f9db2ae5742]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00244:7cf754fef645]]\n问题一 & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00245:8b149ac7a637]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00246:21fcc5271111]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00247:953770840e85]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00248:20dfabd8e61a]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00249:b11b4ca186c0]]\n问题二 & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00250:74108f23c316]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00251:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00252:cbeedc3ac5c5]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00253:47aff7597f86]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00254:b11b4ca186c0]]\n问题三 & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00255:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00256:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00257:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00258:6743de43c0ac]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00259:b11b4ca186c0]]\n问题四（如有） & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00260:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00261:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00262:47aff7597f86]] & [[PROTECTED:F00001-P00263:47aff7597f86]][[PROTECTED:F00001-P00264:b11b4ca186c0]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00265:76ac79294e9f]]\n[[PROTECTED:F00001-P00266:20f5534ac79d]]",
